{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12226510","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12226510","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1222651001:1":{"text":"あの二人は懸賞金ほしさにでまかせを言ってるだけだ！俺の情報は間違いなく信用できるぞ、命を賭けてもいい！","source_cn":"那两个家伙只想骗取赏金，我的情报才保真，我敢用自己这条...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D8286A388CA2336","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1222651002:1":{"text":"知っていることを話せ。","source_cn":"你知道些什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA61BCD873BD97D05","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1222651003:1":{"text":"俺は小舟を二艘持ってるんだが、一艘は普段使ってなくて、ドックに止めてあるんだ。","source_cn":"我有两艘小船停靠在码头，其中一艘不常用，一直栓在船坞里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA69FD79B4F013BC0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1222651004:1":{"text":"でも昨日、その船のロープが切られてたんだよ！","source_cn":"可我昨天发现，那艘船的绳子被割开了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8464D220CBD92C67","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1222651005:1":{"text":"そして俺はこの目で指名手配犯を見たんだ！とっさに駆けつけてなかったら、俺の船は盗まれてたに違いない！","source_cn":"我亲眼看见通缉犯了！她想偷我的船！要不是我去的及时，我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE6DE00B4C4E23C52","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","doc